  "description": "Official .NET 10 client library for integration with the KsefLab.pl (kseflab.pl) API, a proxy for the Polish\n      KSeF (Krajowy System e-Faktur) e-invoicing system. Provides typed HTTP client, authentication handling and\n      request/response models.\n\n      Formerly published as PikSystems.Ksef.Client (versions up to 10.1.1) - renamed to KsefLab.Client to reflect\n      that this client only ever talks to kseflab.pl, not directly to the government KSeF API. Versioning continues\n      from the previous name (this release is 10.1.2). Only KsefLab.Client is maintained going forward; the old\n      PikSystems.Ksef.Client package will not receive further updates.",
